"""
Model 1 inference wrapper for the SmartSpectra Streamlit demo.

This module handles the loading of fine-tuned MST++ checkpoints and the reconstruction
of 31-band hyperspectral cubes (400-1000 nm) from RGB fruit photos. It also provides
the core spectral processing tools (SNV, SG-Derivative, Ratios) used by Model 2.

Technical Note:
Reconstruction uses per-image min-max normalization to match the training dataset
distribution. Standard 0-255 normalization is avoided as it produces near-zero outputs.
"""
